      "word_count": 208,
      "raw_text": "Page 1 of 3 \n \nASSAM SCHEDULE VIII FORM NO. 127 \nHIGH COURT CRIMINAL FORM (M) 166 \n \nIN THE COURT OF THE CHIEF JUDICIAL MAGISTRATE, SEPPA, EAST KAMENG \nARUNACHAL PRADESH \nCR No. 04/25 \nIn DV Case No. 03/2024 \nSmti. Meti Tayem Liyak -vs- Shri Logo Liyak  \nDate \nOrder \nSignature \n \n17.06.2025 \n \nComplainant is present along with her learned Legal Aid \nCounsel for the complainant Mr. T. Gyadi. \n \nAccused is present along with his learned Legal Aid Counsel \nfor the complainant Mr. R. Bodo. \n \nToday this case was fixed for appearance of the accused. \n \nThe accused has paid sum of Rs. 35,000/- to the \ncomplainant to clear arrear of interim maintenance and assured to \npay the remaining arrear amount of Rs. 25,000/- on or before 25th \nof this month. The accused is taken into custody and released on \nbail with the following terms and conditions: \n1. He shall furnish one surety. \n2. He shall pay the interim maintenance amount to the \ncomplainant on time. \n3. He shall regularly appear before the court as and when \ncalled for. \n \nIn violation of above terms and conditions, the bail shall be \ncancelled without notice. \n \n List the case along with main case which is fixed on Lok \nadalat i.e. on 13.09.25. \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n(Habung Tangu) \nCJM, Seppa"
